    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Room2Room?</h2> Room2Room is an analog horror game, tasking players with both surviving 'playtest' scenarios in &quot;The House&quot;, and using &quot;The Computer&quot; to investigate and uncover the mysteries behind the abnormal Room2Room handheld gaming console. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880630/extras/daaa8cf7f51a1e22b6be3850bee156cd.avif?t=1744924640\" width=616 height=312 /></span><br>The main event - step into the shoes of a young playtester in a found-footage styled point-and-click survival horror.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Name your playtesters.<br></li><li>Explore The House, room by room, in a realistic VHS aesthetic. <br></li><li>Open the Room2Room device to swap to a distorted PSX-styled version of each room.<br></li><li>Make changes in real-life, and see how they affect the Room2Room\u2019s world. <br></li><li>Solve odd puzzles for uncanny cartoon characters that appear in the device.<br></li><li>Hide from \u201chome invasions\u201d.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880630/extras/138fba011048525870dfcec864c559de.avif?t=1744924640\" width=616 height=312 /></span><br>A short break, to compose yourself and prepare.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Navigate a Windows 95-style company-issued computer. <br></li><li>View new emails as days pass, download new applications and device upgrades. <br></li><li>Feeling stuck? Read &quot;Findings&quot; to learn about Room2Room's abnormal character roster to help prepare for new playtests.<br></li><li>Customize your desktop wallpaper, listen to some tunes.<br></li><li>Keep track of progress-related achievements.<br></li><li>Play Pong!</li></ul><br><i>There's a way to uncover more behind this odd, chilling narrative. Only in utilizing elements from both The Computer and The House, can you truly find answers, and make a decision.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is Room2Room?</h2> Room2Room is an analog horror game, tasking players with both surviving 'playtest' scenarios in &quot;The House&quot;, and using &quot;The Computer&quot; to investigate and uncover the mysteries behind the abnormal Room2Room handheld gaming console. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880630/extras/daaa8cf7f51a1e22b6be3850bee156cd.avif?t=1744924640\" width=616 height=312 /></span><br>The main event - step into the shoes of a young playtester in a found-footage styled point-and-click survival horror.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Name your playtesters.<br></li><li>Explore The House, room by room, in a realistic VHS aesthetic. <br></li><li>Open the Room2Room device to swap to a distorted PSX-styled version of each room.<br></li><li>Make changes in real-life, and see how they affect the Room2Room\u2019s world. <br></li><li>Solve odd puzzles for uncanny cartoon characters that appear in the device.<br></li><li>Hide from \u201chome invasions\u201d.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880630/extras/138fba011048525870dfcec864c559de.avif?t=1744924640\" width=616 height=312 /></span><br>A short break, to compose yourself and prepare.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Navigate a Windows 95-style company-issued computer. <br></li><li>View new emails as days pass, download new applications and device upgrades. <br></li><li>Feeling stuck? Read &quot;Findings&quot; to learn about Room2Room's abnormal character roster to help prepare for new playtests.<br></li><li>Customize your desktop wallpaper, listen to some tunes.<br></li><li>Keep track of progress-related achievements.<br></li><li>Play Pong!</li></ul><br><i>There's a way to uncover more behind this odd, chilling narrative. Only in utilizing elements from both The Computer and The House, can you truly find answers, and make a decision.</i>",
